The line item applies to the widow repairs per C-FIX.
Scope of work:
Fire Remediation & Restoration – Windows and Sliding Glass Doors (Labor Only) Fire remediation and restoration of ten (10) large windows and
nine (9) sliding glass doors at 935 Chattanooga Ave, Pacific Palisades, CA 90272, affected by smoke and soot exposure. Process includes HEPA
vacuum removal of soot and ash from frames, tracks and assemblies, wet neutralization to eliminate smoke film and odor, inspection and adjustment
of roller assemblies for proper alignment and closure, silicone lubrication, and final operational verification. Work performed under insurance
restoration protocols and post-fire remediation standards.
Materials and any component replacements are excluded and will be quoted separately via change order if required upon inspection.
Labor only.
Materials & replacements, if required, will be issued as a separate change order with photos. 90-day workmanship warranty.
